   "source": [
    "## 4.6 Visual comparison of vulnerability boxes (advanced task)\n",
    "\n",
    "Each row shows one requirement; columns compare Baseline and Adaptive over the same scenarios. Choose two inputs in `PRIM_PLOT_INPUTS`. When Adaptive has no qualifying box, a qualifying Baseline box is shown as a labelled reference, with density and coverage recalculated for Adaptive. This reference is not a successful Adaptive discovery.\n",
    "\n",
    "The rectangle is a projection: restrictions on other inputs remain in the exported bounds table. A small or missing box does not imply that the plan has no vulnerabilities.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 25,
   "id": "2179c5cf",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
